Z||000007||TwisT||03-14-2001||09:37 AM||||My "other" toy:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smcb.JPG"> <P>It's a '76 CB750K HEAVILY modified.  Dyna ignition,  4-into-1 pipe and rejetted with K&N filters,  custom seat,  new clutch,  superbike bars,  superbike front fender,  removed passenger-peg bars,  etc...  This summer,  she'll be getting a gear reduction as well as bright red paint.  =)<P>Not nearly as fast as the sport bikes I've owned,  but it's CHEAP and lot's of fun.  I also have a '76 CB750F in the works.<P>Brett  ||||reg||1
